1. Copy High_Fidelity_0.post.msh of RVE from training stage
2. Copy strain-displacement correlation matrix from offline stage
3. Copy strain interpolation parameters from multiscale analysis
4. Run python3 MultiscaleROMApplication/reduction-stage/reconstruct_rve.py -h 
to know the input parameters
5. Output is a .res file to be open in GiD
